WEBVTT

00:09:28.720 --> 00:09:30.744
ni uwekezaji makini,

00:09:30.768 --> 00:09:33.537
tunazo suluhu zilizothibitishwa,

00:09:33.561 --> 00:09:35.514
na tunao mwanzo wa safari.

00:09:35.538 --> 00:09:36.689
Lakini nini kitatokea

00:09:36.713 --> 00:09:38.847
Pale tutakapotokomeza
ukatili dhidi ya watoto?

00:09:38.871 --> 00:09:40.468
Hebu tutafakari kwa muda.

00:09:41.805 --> 00:09:44.607
Kwanza, tafakari kuhusu
watoto niliowataja.

00:09:44.631 --> 00:09:47.298
Sarah hatalala tena kitandani
kwake usiku,

00:09:47.322 --> 00:09:49.695
akihofu juu ya sauti ya
hatua za baba yake wa kambo

00:09:49.719 --> 00:09:51.119
akija juu kwenye ngazi.

00:09:51.942 --> 00:09:54.458
Faisal atakwenda shule 
na atanawiri.

00:09:54.482 --> 00:09:56.887
Hataogopa tena kuwa shuleni

00:09:56.911 --> 00:10:00.021
na kuonewa na kupigwa
na kudhalilishwa na walimu.